 "name_en": "Direct Material Sourcing (4RD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Direct Material Sourcing (4RD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Direct material sourcing process allows the central purchaser to get an overview of all the direct material requirements across various plants and carry out the sourcing of the material requirements appropriately.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this process, the central purchaser can create a sourcing event (sourcing project) to conduct sourcing with the competitive suppliers. The central purchaser can evaluate them to finally award the business to one or more capable suppliers, and create relevant documents such as purchase orders or central contracts to enable operational procurement of direct materials.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sourcing project</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add competitive suppliers to provide competitive bids</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add right set of supporting documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Negotiate with select suppliers in multiple rounds as needed</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and manage awarding scenarios</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order or central contract</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get cost savings</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve efficiency by shortened sourcing cycle time</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain process transparency</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate source to contract business process fully</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>直接物料寻源 (4RD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">直接物料寻源流程允许集中采购员了解不同工厂的所有直接物料需求，并相应地执行物料需求寻源。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此流程中，集中采购员可以创建寻源事件（寻源项目）以与竞争供应商进行寻源。集中采购员可以对其进行评估，最终将业务授标给一个或多个有能力的供应商，并创建采购订单或集中合同等相关凭证以启用直接物料的运营采购。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建寻源项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加竞争性供应商以提供竞争性投标</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加一组正确的支持文档</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据需要与选定的供应商进行多轮谈判</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和管理授标场景</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购订单或集中合同</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8996e524f5d0415cb411af3c429ed558__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">节省成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">缩短寻源周期，提高效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高流程透明度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将货源完全集成到合同业务流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
